A '''Flipflopper''' is a [[Critter]] that can be [[Hunting|Hunted]] on the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}}.

== Spawning ==
A '''Flipflopper''' has a {{Green|50%}} chance to spawn from an [[Exploding Lily Pad]].

== Behavior ==
'''Flipfloppers''' swim around in water. If the player throws a {{Item|Medium Fishing Net}} or better at it, they receive high knockback.

